    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone can be a detective; it requires practical skills and logical thinking. Some people, however, pursue their dreams despite common sense. Your new partner, Eva, is just that type of person\u2014lacking skills but full of motivation to become the best detective in the city. No one has lasted more than a month as her partner, and everyone at the agency is betting on how long you'll stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;My Furry Detective&quot;</strong> is a comedy detective story about motivation, hard work, and dreams. Investigate the crime, spend time with your partner, and who knows, maybe you\u2019ll hit it off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A captivating story with romance and comedy elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HD, fully original artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 2 hours of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming detective!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone can be a detective; it requires practical skills and logical thinking. Some people, however, pursue their dreams despite common sense. Your new partner, Eva, is just that type of person\u2014lacking skills but full of motivation to become the best detective in the city. No one has lasted more than a month as her partner, and everyone at the agency is betting on how long you'll stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;My Furry Detective&quot;</strong> is a comedy detective story about motivation, hard work, and dreams. Investigate the crime, spend time with your partner, and who knows, maybe you\u2019ll hit it off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A captivating story with romance and comedy elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HD, fully original artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 2 hours of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming detective!</p></li></ul>",
